        },
        "text_UwVCpK": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Labareau’s products contain 97% skin-identical atelocollagen, a highly absorbable form of collagen that mimics the collagen naturally found in your skin. This allows for deeper penetration into the skin’s layers, but also delivers additional collagen directly to the skin, actively replenishing and restoring lost collagen and stimulating its production. Unlike other products that only hydrate the surface, Labareau works within the skin to rebuild and restore its structure.</p>",
