        "text_Xd6C9b": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Exposure to environmental factors like UV rays and pollution generates free radicals, which damage the skin at the cellular level. These free radicals break down collagen and elastin, leading to fine lines, pigmentation, and a loss of firmness. Over time, oxidative stress accelerates the visible signs of aging.</p>",
            "block_padding_top": 0,
            "block_padding_bottom": 20,
            "block_padding_left": 0,
            "block_padding_right": 0,
            "block_border_color": "#000000",
