        "text_VxqF9C": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Labareau’s Bioactive Peptides work to neutralize free radicals, reducing oxidative damage and preventing further breakdown of skin proteins.   <br/><br/>Additionally, these peptides stimulate collagen and elastin production, repairing existing damage and strengthening the skin’s defenses against future oxidative stress. This dual action enhances resilience, firmness, and radiance.</p>",
            "block_padding_top": 0,
            "block_padding_bottom": 20,
            "block_padding_left": 0,
            "block_padding_right": 0,
