        "text_VEWwgV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p><a href=\"https://labareau.com/pages/labareau-how-it-works#\" title=\"#\"><strong>Labareau’s Peptides</strong></a> stand apart from regular peptides found in many skincare products due to their targeted design and superior absorption capabilities.</p><p><strong>Regular Peptides</strong></p><ul><li>Remain on the skin’s surface, providing minimal cellular interaction. </li><li>May offer superficial hydration but do not deeply stimulate skin repair.</li></ul><p><strong>Labareau’s Peptides</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Deep Penetration:</strong> Engineered to reach deeper layers and interact directly with fibroblasts, boosting collagen and elastin production. </li><li><strong>Dual Action:</strong> Neutralizes free radicals and actively repairs structural damage at the cellular level. </li><li><strong>Targeted Precision:</strong> Formulated to specifically stimulate natural regeneration processes, enhancing firmness and resilience.</li></ul><p>This multi-layered approach delivers comprehensive moisture, boosting elasticity and promoting a plump, rejuvenated complexion.</p>",
            "block_padding_top": 0,
            "block_padding_bottom": 0,
            "block_padding_left": 0,
